---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';

const REPO = 'https://github.com/yusufaf/oil-on-cotton';
---

<Page
	title="Takedown · Oil on Cotton"
	description="How a shop, a museum or a rights holder can have a piece or a whole shop removed from Oil on Cotton."
	heading="Takedown"
	lede="A shop, a museum or a rights holder can have a piece, or a whole shop, removed from this index."
>
	<h2>How to ask</h2>
	<p>
		Email <a href="mailto:hello@oiloncotton.com">hello@oiloncotton.com</a> with the room or the piece, and who you are
		asking for. You can also open an <a href={`${REPO}/issues`}>issue on GitHub</a>, but issues are public.
	</p>

	<h2>What happens</h2>
	<p>
		Requests are handled within 48 hours. A removed piece leaves the site and is not listed again. A shop that asks to
		be excluded is removed whole, and the crawler stops reading it.
	</p>

	<h2>The removal log</h2>
	<p>
		Each removal is recorded in <a href={`${REPO}/blob/main/data/removals.yaml`}>data/removals.yaml</a>, with the date
		and a short reason, and no names or contact details. Earlier versions of the data stay in the repository's history.
	</p>
</Page>
